DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
-----------------
KeyParse should be:
- schema-less
- library-agnostic at its core
- additive rather than invasive
- lazy
- current-node scoped for explicit reader API
- compatible with existing JSON values
- safe for existing POJO/DB mappings
- opt-in when changing POJO property resolution

The key distinction:
Jackson owns the JSON.
KeyParse interprets additional semantics encoded in property names.
